  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A mount: msm:rideable lets a player get on with an empty hand and steer it once it wears a vanilla saddle (shown by the saddle bone). It walks and jumps with the jump bar at strength 0.7, stepping up full blocks (step_height 1). Its ridden speed is its movement speed (0.25); sneaking dismounts. It spawns in plains and meadows in groups of two to four (rule animal: on grass in daylight). msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto: GeckoLib draws it where the target has GeckoLib, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game."
  }
